  "guideTargetTitle": "1. Targets & Goals",
  "guideTargetDesc": "Set your Daily Target in Settings. **You can choose to track by Pages or Ayahs.** Your Weekly Target is simply your daily target x 7. You can accumulate reading on weekends to meet the weekly goal.",
  "guideMushafTitle": "2. Mushaf Mode (Page View)",
  "guideMushafDesc": "• **Timer:** Starts automatically when you open a page.\n• **Progress:** Swiping to the next page counts the previous one as read (after reading for at least 20 seconds).\n• **Manual Mark:** Use the **Green Checklist Button** (bottom right) to save your last position without changing pages.",
  "guideListTitle": "3. List Mode (Ayah View)",
  "guideListDesc": "• **No Timer:** We focus on Ayah count here, not duration.\n• **Progress:** Tap an ayah and select **Mark as Last Read**. We calculate how many new ayahs you've read since your last session.\n• *Example:* If you last read Ayah 5, and today mark Ayah 20, we record **15 new ayahs**.",
  "guideInsightTitle": "4. Stats & Streak",
  "guideInsightDesc": "• **Unique Pages:** In Mushaf Mode, we track *Unique Pages* for Khatam progress. Reading the same page twice won't double your 'Total Pages' count, but the duration is added!\n• **Streak:** Read at least 1 ayah/page daily to keep your streak alive.",
